Summary patch, PS1-only:

MainActivity.java
- Add ps1CurrentAudioTrack and ps1AudioThread.
- AHPS1.ps1Stop() now calls stopPs1Audio() before NativePs1CoreBridge.stopSafe().
- Before NativePs1CoreBridge.bootSafe(), stopPs1Audio() is called for a clean PS1 audio restart.
- startPs1Audio() now:
  - hard-stops any previous PS1 audio thread,
  - creates a larger AudioTrack buffer,
  - preloads audio frames before at.play(),
  - uses AudioTrack.WRITE_BLOCKING on API 23+,
  - logs BUILD2SA3B PS1_AUDIO_START / WRITE / STOP.
- Keeps android.media.AudioManager.STREAM_MUSIC to avoid the GitHub compile error.

nap_ps1_native.cpp
- Add nap_audio_clear().
- Call nap_audio_clear() after old core unload in ps1Boot().
- Call nap_audio_clear() in ps1Stop().

No Sega/Atari/build metadata files are part of this overlay.
